Comment: microscope-importer is a Rust program and the binary in this package
 links the crates listed in Cargo.lock in statically, so the shipped
 /usr/bin/microscope-importer is a combined work that also carries their code.
 None of them is distributed as source here; the exact set and versions are
 recorded in Cargo.lock in the source tree, and "cargo metadata" over that
 tree prints the licence of each one. They are under permissive licences
 (mostly "MIT OR Apache-2.0"), all compatible with the AGPL-3.0-or-later of
 the program itself, which is the licence the combined binary is distributed
 under.

